      "desc:8": "The closing trial of the zone — the old diesel gamble, rebuilt on verifiable ground: light up serious EU generation an era or two before the tech tree says you may. The old book asked for a diesel multiblock and paid in casings; this one asks for the steam-to-EU spine itself.\n\nHand in the Gear Steam Compressor and a Mega Steam Turbine Array controller: the compressor turns 25,600 L/s of plain steam into 6,400 L/s of superheated on steel, and the turbine's ceilings run 150 to 300 percent by steam grade. Together they are a power plant that fits in a HV-era yard.\n\nWhen the lights stop flickering, the challenge zone is done. The exchange zone takes it from here.",
